    <!-- v10: caffeine notice, heat-map bars, per-day pace -->
    <string name="caffeine_notice">You sleep at %1$s: from %2$s ease off coffee, tea and mate. %3$d h is a minimum — the earlier, the better.</string>
    <string name="caffeine_setting">Caffeine notice</string>
    <string name="caffeine_setting_hint">Shows a reminder on Home, %1$d h before your bedtime, to ease off coffee, tea and mate. The %1$d h is a floor, not an exact line: it depends on how much caffeine you had (a light tea has room to spare, a long mate session needs more margin). Informational only: it does not affect your goal or streaks.</string>
